        "h": "9. Definitive Strategic Recommendation by Business Persona",
        "body": "<p style=\"margin-bottom: 14px; line-height: 1.75;\">To remove all ambiguity, review this proven persona matching matrix:</p>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong>Scenario A: Amazon FBA Private Label targeting the United States</strong><br/>\n  👉 <strong>Choose: US LLC (Wyoming or New Mexico)</strong>. Provides 0% state income tax, domestic ACH payout integration with Mercury/Wise, and satisfies all Amazon US tax interview requirements.</p>\n\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong>Scenario B: Bootstrapped Freelancer or Digital Agency (Budget under £250)</strong><br/>\n  👉 <strong>Choose: UK LTD (<a href=\"/uk-services/uk-ltd-formation\" style=\"color: #06b6d4; text-decoration: underline;\">Silver Package £170</a>)</strong>. Ready in 24 hours with full Companies House ID verification, London registered office address, authentication code, and instant Stripe eligibility.</p>\n\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong>Scenario C: Multi-Channel E-Commerce (Shopify + TikTok Shop + Walmart)</strong><br/>\n  👉 <strong>Choose: US LLC (<a href=\"/usa-services/us-llc-formation/choose-state\" style=\"color: #06b6d4; text-decoration: underline;\">Silver Package $200</a>)</strong>. Delivers a unique commercial business address, EIN confirmation, and eligibility for Walmart Marketplace onboarding.</p>\n\n  <p style=\"margin-bottom: 0;\"><strong>Scenario D: Dual-Entity Global Power Structure</strong><br/>\n  👉 Established brands often operate both: a UK LTD handling European customer sales and a US LLC capturing North American GMV, achieving global currency diversification and maximum resilience.</p>\n</div>"
