        "h": "10. Frequently Asked Questions: US LLC vs. UK LTD Decoded",
        "body": "<div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n  <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #38bdf8;\">Q1: Can I open a UK LTD and a US LLC under the exact same brand name?</h4>\n  <p style=\"margin: 0; line-height: 1.7;\">Yes. You can form 'Apex Commerce Ltd' in the UK with Companies House and 'Apex Commerce LLC' in Wyoming. They operate as sister corporate entities, allowing you to route European sales through the UK and North American sales through the US.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n  <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #38bdf8;\">Q2: What is the new Companies House ID Verification rule for UK LTDs?</h4>\n  <p style=\"margin: 0; line-height: 1.7;\">Under the Economic Crime and Corporate Transparency Act (ECCTA), Companies House mandates that every company director and person with significant control (PSC) must complete verified identity verification using their passport. DigiFormation includes full ID verification in our Silver package (£170) completed in 24 hours.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px;\">\n  <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #38bdf8;\">Q3: Which entity is cheaper to maintain annually?</h4>\n  <p style=\"margin: 0; line-height: 1.7;\">A New Mexico US LLC is the cheapest ($0 annual state fee). Wyoming costs $62/year. A UK LTD requires an annual Confirmation Statement (£34 fee) plus annual accounts preparation. If you have substantial profits, the US LLC's pass-through status saves thousands in UK corporation tax.</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 20px; line-height: 1.75;\">Need help deciding? Contact DigiFormation on WhatsApp at +92 316 4467464 or start your <a href=\"/usa-services/us-llc-formation/choose-state\" style=\"color: #06b6d4; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\">US LLC Formation</a> or <a href=\"/uk-services/uk-ltd-formation\" style=\"color: #06b6d4; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\">UK LTD Formation</a> online today.</p>"
