        "h": "12. Frequently Asked Questions: Amazon FBA for Non-Residents",
        "body": "<div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n  <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #38bdf8;\">Q1: Can Amazon ban my account for operating from outside the United States?</h4>\n  <p style=\"margin: 0; line-height: 1.7;\">No. Amazon Seller Central explicitly welcomes international sellers from over 100 countries. You do not need to hide your IP address. However, your business identity must be transparent: declare your real foreign identity on the tax interview while operating your legitimate US LLC.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n  <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #38bdf8;\">Q2: What is an Amazon Section 3 deactivation and how do I prevent it?</h4>\n  <p style=\"margin: 0; line-height: 1.7;\">A Section 3 suspension occurs when Amazon suspects identity deception, multiple unlinked seller accounts, or fraudulent inventory documentation. Prevent it by ensuring your LLC name, address, and bank statements match across all records.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n  <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #38bdf8;\">Q3: Do I need an ITIN to sell on Amazon FBA?</h4>\n  <p style=\"margin: 0; line-height: 1.7;\">No. You can launch and sell using your company's EIN and foreign passport on the W-8BEN tax interview. However, acquiring an ITIN later (included in DigiFormation's Gold Package) is recommended if you ever need to file personal US returns or open advanced merchant accounts.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px;\">\n  <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #38bdf8;\">Q4: What is an Amazon Brand Registry violation and how do I avoid it?</h4>\n  <p style=\"margin: 0; line-height: 1.7;\">Brand Registry violations occur when sellers attempt to register trademarks using third-party agents not authorized by the USPTO, or when product listings misrepresent licensed brands. Always ensure your trademark is filed under your authentic LLC name.</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 20px; line-height: 1.75;\">Ready to launch your Amazon FBA business? Start your <a href=\"/usa-services/us-llc-formation/choose-state\" style=\"color: #06b6d4; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\">US LLC Formation</a> with DigiFormation today and secure complete e-commerce verification.</p>"
