        "h": "9. Frequently Asked Questions: Open-Source Business Software vs Proprietary SaaS",
        "body": "<div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n  <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #38bdf8;\">Q1: Is open-source software really free to use for commercial businesses?</h4>\n  <p style=\"margin: 0; line-height: 1.7;\">Yes. The tools featured on DigiBizOS are distributed under permissive open-source licenses (such as MIT, Apache 2.0, and AGPLv3). You are legally permitted to deploy, modify, and utilize these tools for internal commercial operations without paying any licensing or subscription fees.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n  <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #38bdf8;\">Q2: What technical specifications are required to host the DigiBizOS suite?</h4>\n  <p style=\"margin: 0; line-height: 1.7;\">A standard cloud Virtual Private Server (VPS) equipped with 4 vCPUs, 8GB to 16GB of RAM, and 80GB of NVMe SSD storage (costing approximately $12 to $25/month on providers like Hetzner, Contabo, or DigitalOcean) can comfortably run the entire suite under normal agency loads.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n  <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #38bdf8;\">Q3: How does DIGI WHATSAPP SALES AGENT communicate without paying Wati fees?</h4>\n  <p style=\"margin: 0; line-height: 1.7;\">It communicates directly with Meta's official WhatsApp Business Cloud API. You only pay Meta's direct, regulated per-conversation wholesale pricing (often just a fraction of a cent), completely eliminating third-party software markups.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n  <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #38bdf8;\">Q4: Can I run DIGI LEAD HUNTER on my personal laptop?</h4>\n  <p style=\"margin: 0; line-height: 1.7;\">Yes. DIGI LEAD HUNTER can be executed locally via Docker on macOS, Windows (via WSL2), or Linux, allowing you to extract and verify prospective client data straight to your local drive without external hosting.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n  <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #38bdf8;\">Q5: What happens if an open-source application experiences a bug?</h4>\n  <p style=\"margin: 0; line-height: 1.7;\">Unlike closed proprietary SaaS where you must wait weeks for customer support tickets, open-source code is fully transparent. You can inspect logs, debug issues, roll back container images, or consult active global open-source developer communities for immediate patches.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n  <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #38bdf8;\">Q6: How does DIGI VOICE STUDIO compare to ElevenLabs audio quality?</h4>\n  <p style=\"margin: 0; line-height: 1.7;\">Modern open-source acoustic neural models achieve over 95% parity with commercial proprietary voice synthesizers, delivering lifelike inflection, natural breath pauses, and authentic regional accents suitable for high-converting commercial advertising.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n  <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #38bdf8;\">Q7: Is my company data secure when hosting open-source software?</h4>\n  <p style=\"margin: 0; line-height: 1.7;\">It is significantly more secure than public cloud SaaS. Your customer records, contracts, and audio files reside on your own dedicated server with your own encryption keys. No third-party SaaS company can access, inspect, or train AI models on your proprietary information.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px;\">\n  <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #38bdf8;\">Q8: How do I get started with DigiBizOS tools?</h4>\n  <p style=\"margin: 0; line-height: 1.7;\">Visit the official <a href=\"https://www.digibizos.co.uk/open-source\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #06b6d4; text-decoration: underline;\">DigiBizOS Open Source Portal</a> to download the deployment scripts and documentation for all four tools completely free of charge.</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 20px; line-height: 1.75;\">Take control of your business sovereignty today: Pair the free open-source software suite on <a href=\"https://www.digibizos.co.uk/open-source\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #06b6d4; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\">DigiBizOS</a> with a fully compliant US entity through <a href=\"/usa-services/us-llc-formation/choose-state\" style=\"color: #06b6d4; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\">DigiFormation's LLC Formation Portal</a>.</p>"
